<title>POLAND: Polisa debuts on Polish OTC at PLN 4.0.</title>
<headline>Polisa debuts on Polish OTC at PLN 4.0.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland's insurance company TUR Polisa SA debuted on the country's over-the-counter market Centralna Tabela Ofert (CTO) at four zlotys, the spokeswoman of CeTo, a firm running the trade, told Reuters on Friday.</p>
<p>Polisa, which has 4.3 million shares listed on the OTC market, also has 4.1 million shares trading on the main market of the Warsaw bourse.</p>
<p>On Thursday Polisa closed at 7.5 zlotys on the bourse.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
